6.3 Referential Integrity
Every evidence.claim_id must exist in historical_claim.

Every revision.claim_id must exist in historical_claim.

Every historian.claim_id must exist in historical_claim.

Every key_date.claim_id must exist in historical_claim.

Every key_figure.claim_id must exist in historical_claim.

Every claim_relation.claim_id and claim_relation.related_claim_id must exist in historical_claim.

Every stag_link.claim_id must exist in historical_claim.

Every work_link.claim_id must exist in historical_claim.

Every provenance.claim_id must exist in historical_claim.

Every moderation.claim_id must exist in historical_claim.

The version chain must be acyclic.

The claim relation must be symmetric where appropriate.

