function contestedClaimView(claimId, auth):

Step 1. validateAuth(auth, "reader"). If not authorized, return an error.

Step 2. Read the claim. If null, return an error.

Step 3. Read the evidence for and the evidence against.

Step 4. Build the view with the evidence on both sides.

Step 5. Return the view.

