12. Validation Engine Design
The registry validates the following.

Validation 1. Claim validity. Every claim is validated against the schema.

Validation 2. STAG annotation validity.

Validation 3. Referential integrity.

Validation 4. Version chain acyclicity.

Validation 5. Work resolution.

Validation 6. Provenance completeness.

Validation 7. Audit completeness.

Validation 8. Moderation completeness.

Validation 9. Period consistency. The period must be consistent with the key dates.

Validation 10. Evidence consistency. The evidence strength must be consistent with the evidence list.

Validation 11. Historian consistency. The historian positions must be consistent with the revisions.

